body:
Walking home from the bar last night pretty drunk and homeless man stopped me and asked me for some money.  I pulled out my wallet and the only bills I had were 20s.  I didn't want to leave him high and dry so I reluctantly handed over the $20 and said "please spend it on food" as he walked away.  Friend I was with was giving me shit for saying that to him.

&amp;#x200B;

